' Phase Dependencies
"Phase 1: Core Enhancements (Q1-Q2 2024)" --> "Phase 2: Business Intelligence (Q3-Q4 2024)"
"Phase 2: Business Intelligence (Q3-Q4 2024)" --> "Phase 3: Enterprise Features (2025)"
"Phase 3: Enterprise Features (2025)" --> "Phase 4: Innovation & Emerging Tech (2026+)"

' Feature Dependencies within phases
"Advanced Search" --> "AI Recommendations" : search data
"Analytics Dashboard" --> "Marketing Automation" : customer insights
"Multi-tenant Architecture" --> "B2B Portal" : infrastructure
"AR/VR Experience" --> "AI-Powered Automation" : user interaction data

' Technical progression
TechStack --> BusinessValue : enables
BusinessValue --> Strategy : guides

note bottom of "Phase 1: Core Enhancements (Q1-Q2 2024)" : **Priority Focus:**\nUser experience and\nperformance optimization

note bottom of "Phase 2: Business Intelligence (Q3-Q4 2024)" : **Priority Focus:**\nData analytics and\nintelligent automation

note bottom of "Phase 3: Enterprise Features (2025)" : **Priority Focus:**\nScalability and\nmarket expansion

note bottom of "Phase 4: Innovation & Emerging Tech (2026+)" : **Priority Focus:**\nInnovation leadership\nand future technologies

